# Giant (plan Y · YD5): while a Dynamaxed Pokémon stands on the field, a choir on the chords,
# horn on the roots and timpani on the bass's beats
track giantchoir choir only=giant double=horn shift=-12 vol=0.2 pan=-0.25 rev=0.4
